---
// /about — what the site is, who it's for, how worksheets are made (§11.5).
import StaticPage from '../components/StaticPage.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../data/site';
---
<StaticPage
    pageTitle="About"
    description="Learn what freekidworksheet.com is, who it's for, and how my free printable worksheets and question papers are made."
    path="/about"
    eyebrow="About"
    heading={`About ${SITE_NAME}`}
    lede="Free printable worksheets and question papers for kids — made to be printed, not scrolled."
>
    <p>
        {SITE_NAME} is a small, independent library of free printable learning
        materials for young learners. I single-handedly built this site because I
        needed a place to easily download worksheets without any hassle. Every resource
        is a single A4 page you can download as an image and print at home or in the
        classroom — no accounts, no paywalls, no watermarks.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-neutral-100">Who it's for</h2>
    <p>
        I'm a teacher myself. While I don't teach these early classes directly, I
        make these worksheets for other teachers at my school. I'm tired of finding and
        signing up to websites just to download worksheets, so I built this site so
        I can download them without any problems. If you like any worksheet, use them;
        otherwise ignore them.
    </p>
    <p>
        I'm sharing them freely for parents helping their children practice at home,
        fellow teachers looking for quick classroom activities, and anyone who wants
        simple, direct printables. The worksheets are grouped by subject category and
        age group so you can find what you need in a few clicks.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-neutral-100">How worksheets are made</h2>
    <p>
        Each worksheet is designed as a clean, print-first A4 page. I publish
        the page as a high-quality image (JPG, PNG, or WebP) so it works on
        any printer and any device without special software. New pages are
        added regularly — browse the library or check the newest additions on
        the home page.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-neutral-100">Why free?</h2>
    <p>
        I believe practice materials for kids shouldn't sit behind signups
        and subscriptions. Printing is 100% free. The site is supported by unobtrusive
        advertising, which lets me keep every worksheet completely free for personal
        and classroom use.
    </p>
</StaticPage>
